title: 'Registrar: Force Register'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      Implements `pallet-registrar-para::force_register`, the root-only port of the relay chain's
      `paras_registrar::force_register`.

      Any id works, the system range included, and it need not be reserved first. The manager
      pays the usual deposits, as with `reserve` + `register`, and the old `deposit` override is
      gone. `NextFreeParaId` moves past a forced public id so `reserve` doesn't collide with it.
      The call sends the existing `Register` message, so the relay chain side is unchanged. It
      comes with a new `force_register` weight.

crates:
  - name: pallet-registrar-para
    bump: major
